graph-agents-cli

This project is a fork of google-agents-cli (https://github.com/google/agents-cli),
Copyright 2026 Google LLC, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Modifications in this fork:
- All Google Cloud specific code paths (Vertex AI, Agent Runtime, Cloud Run, GKE,
  Gemini Enterprise, gcloud authentication, Terraform, BigQuery analytics) removed.
- Agent framework changed from Google ADK to LangGraph.
- Deployment target changed to any Kubernetes cluster via Helm, with Argo CD or
  self-hosted-runner continuous delivery.
- Evaluation backend replaced with local deterministic checks and an in-process
  model judge; observability replaced with LangSmith or OpenTelemetry under an
  explicit opt-in.
- Package, command, manifest, environment variable, and skills names renamed.

Files retained from the original project keep their Google LLC copyright headers.
New files are Copyright 2026 graph-agents-cli contributors, licensed under the
same Apache License, Version 2.0.
